{"4965310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Sovereign's Board", "steam_appid": 4965310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sovereign's Board </strong>is an online 1v1, 3D, simultaneous turn-based strategy game where players assume the role of rival gods, each commanding a team of three mages in a battle for control of the board to gain power over the other. Utilizing the simultaneous turn based system, players must command their units to move, attack, and outmaneuver their opponent. Each unit features unique abilities that can be combined in creative ways, enabling diverse tactical approaches. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Face off against your rival</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965310/extras/d7719a60bd904322d01ef6bd89522f09.poster.avif?t=1787052935\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965310/extras/d7719a60bd904322d01ef6bd89522f09.webm?t=1787052935\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965310/extras/d7719a60bd904322d01ef6bd89522f09.mp4?t=1787052935\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Utilize unique characters</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965310/extras/d645f002d081c245a60d0af5c3b651fc.poster.avif?t=1787052935\" width=240 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4965310/extras/d645f002d081c245a60d0af5c3b651fc.webm?t=1787052935\" type=\"video/webm